CORE
main.c
--pointer-check --bounds-check
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
_strftime is the object-file name of strftime on macOS.  On macOS the
test relied on <time.h> declaring strftime with the asm label _strftime,
which cbmc no longer applies (a label that is the name with a leading
underscore names the function itself); it now declares _strftime
everywhere.
